  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"687\">\n<p data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"687\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"635\">DEL(7q)</strong> indicates deletion on the long arm of chromosome 7.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"773\">\n<p data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"773\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Common in <strong data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"735\">Myelodysplastic Syndromes (MDS)</strong> and <strong data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"772\">Acute Myeloid Leukemia (AML)</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"873\">\n<p data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"873\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Associated with <strong data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"810\">poor prognosis</strong>, especially when present with other cytogenetic abnormalities.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"955\">\n<p data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"955\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Detection assists in diagnosis, classification, and risk stratification of MDS.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
